;; Go-build variant of sun.reflect.generics.reflectiveObjects.TypeVariableImpl (J2G-SPEC §4.6;
;; doc/classes/JAVA-DEFERRED-TRIAGE.md, "As built: F25 (write-ahead)", "As built: JCS271 (b) (write-ahead)"): read
;; by j2g only. jdk26u's class is translated whole but for getGenericDeclaration, which returns the declaration
;; itself, where jdk26u copies a Method or Constructor through ReflectionFactory (jrt's Method and Constructor hold
;; no mutable state but the accessible flag). Since JCS271 (b) its annotation members are jdk26u's (F25's variant
;; replaced them while no type annotations were recorded): TypeAnnotationParser reads the recorded
;; RuntimeVisibleTypeAnnotations, AnnotationType and AnnotationSupport map them. Copyright (c) the Arbace authors;
;; Eclipse Public License 1.0.
(in-ns 'sun.reflect.generics.reflectiveObjects)

(j2g/variant TypeVariableImpl
  (method ^:public getGenericDeclaration ^D [this]
    (.-genericDeclaration this)))
